msgstr "触れず買い：手を触れないうちは{0}引き。"

#: scripts/Core/Build.cs:662
msgid "The Guild comes tonight for {0}g, and you'd have {1}g left."
msgstr "今夜ギルドが{0}Gを取り立てに来ますが、買うと残りは{1}Gになります。"

#: scripts/Core/Build.cs:667
msgid " (sellers will ask about {0} more once they hear of it)"
msgstr "（噂が広まれば、売り手の言い値は約{0}上がります）"

#: scripts/Core/Build.cs:668
msgid ""
"After the {0}, two typical chests {1} would cost about {2}g{3}, and you'd have {4}g. You may not be able to afford chests for a while."
msgstr "{0}の購入後、{1}並の宝箱を2つ買うには約{2}G{3}かかりますが、残りは{4}Gです。しばらく宝箱を買えなくなるかもしれません。"

