#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:53
msgid ""
"Read a chest true that hid something (a false bottom or a ward), or one holding five things or more."
msgstr "何かを隠した宝箱（二重底か結界）か、品が5つ以上入った宝箱を、完璧に見立てる。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:54
msgid "Settle a stolen chest: send it home, or hand it to the Wardens."
msgstr "盗品の宝箱の始末をつける。持ち主に返すか、衛士に引き渡す。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:55
msgid "Fill a commission: every thing it asked for, delivered."
msgstr "依頼をひとつ果たす。求められた品を、すべて納品する。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:56
msgid ""
"Pick an old lock without force: a Guild Lock masterfully, or a Dwarven Tumbler cleanly."
msgstr "古い錠を、こじ開けずに開ける。ギルド錠なら見事に、ドワーフのタンブラー錠ならきれいに。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:138
msgid ""
"{0} of the treasury key came by Guild courier, with a master's fee of {1}g and Mister Vane's compliments."
msgstr "宝物庫の鍵の一片「{0}」が、ギルドの使者の手で届いた。名匠の謝礼{1}Gと、ヴェイン氏のご挨拶を添えて。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:197
msgid "The Guild took {0} on its night, to work off the note."
msgstr "ギルドの夜、{0}は手形の分を働いて返すため、ギルドに連れていかれた。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:204
msgid ""
"The Guild's men came to the back door for {0}. Their note still stood, and they took them back."
msgstr "ギルドの者たちが、{0}を迎えに裏口へ来た。手形はまだ有効で、そのまま連れ戻されていった。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:222
msgid ""
"{0} is in the back room: gold from head to foot, and knocking now and then."
msgstr "{0}が奥の間にいる。頭から爪先まで金で、ときおりノックしている。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:232
msgid ""
"Your mimic ate the gold off {0}, and fell asleep again. They're cold, and shaking, and alive."
msgstr "ミミックが{0}を覆う金を食べ、また眠りについた。凍えて、震えて、それでも生きている。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:245
msgid "You paid {0}'s note to the Guild: {1}g."
msgstr "{0}の手形をギルドに払った：{1}G。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:260
msgid "{0} walked home tonight. Cold, and furious with the Guild, and home."
msgstr "今夜、{0}は歩いて家に帰った。体は冷えきり、ギルドへの怒りに燃えて、それでも家に帰りついた。"

#: scripts/Core/Campaign.cs:358
msgid ""
"The millwright's chest. My father's tools are in it, and the wheel won't turn without them. One coin, for luck."
msgstr "水車大工の宝箱です。父の道具が入っていて、それがないと水車が回らないんです。硬貨一枚だけ、縁起かつぎに。"

