msgid_plural "{0} things"
msgstr[0] "{0}点"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:486
msgid "Your restorers"
msgstr "お抱えの修復師"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:489
msgid "{0}: {1} swung!"
msgstr "{0}：{1}の品質が振れた！"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:490
msgid "{0}: {1} mended."
msgstr "{0}：{1}を修繕した。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:491
msgid "{0}: {1} held steady."
msgstr "{0}：{1}が品質を保った。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:492
msgid "{0}: {1} tempered!"
msgstr "{0}：{1}が鍛え直された！"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:493
msgid "{0}: {1} came out better!"
msgstr "{0}：{1}が一段上になった！"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:501
msgid "Nim the Peddler"
msgstr "行商人ニム"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:505
msgid ""
"Saw the Guild's carriage go by with Bram in it. He waved. Bram never waves. Well! Curios."
msgstr "ニム、見たよ。ギルドの馬車がブラムを乗せて通っていった。手を振ってた。ブラムは手なんか振らないのに。さてと！珍品だよ。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:509
msgid ""
"Psst! Keywright! Shutters down? Good. Nim's pack is full of things that came out of chests and never went back in."
msgstr "ちょいと、鍵師さん！鎧戸は下ろした？よしよし。ニムの荷袋には、宝箱から出てきたっきり二度と戻らなかった物がぎっしりさ。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:510
msgid ""
"Evening! Nim kept the good ones for you. Well. Nim kept some ones for you."
msgstr "こんばんは！ニム、いいのを取っといたよ。いや、まあ……ニム、何かしらは取っといたよ。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:511
msgid ""
"Quick, before the Guild's night watch comes round the corner. Look, look, but don't point."
msgstr "急いで、ギルドの夜回りが角を曲がってくる前に。見て見て、でも指はささないでね。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:512
msgid ""
"Out of a wizard's strongroom, these, this very night. The wizard won't miss them. Nim checked."
msgstr "魔法使いの宝物庫から、今夜出てきたばかりの品だよ。魔法使いは惜しがりゃしないさ。ニムがちゃんと確かめたもの。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:513
msgid "A good day? Nim heard. Nim hears everything after dark."
msgstr "いい一日だった？ニム、聞いたよ。日が暮れたら、ニムの耳には何でも入るのさ。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:518
msgid "Good eye. Nim would have kept that one, if Nim were the keeping sort."
msgstr "お目が高い。ニムが物を取っておく性分なら、そいつは手放さなかったね。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:519
msgid "Done! Treat it kindly. It's older than the Guild."
msgstr "毎度！大事にしてやってね。ギルドより年寄りなんだから。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:520
msgid "It likes you. Nim can always tell when they like someone."
msgstr "そいつ、あんたを気に入ってるよ。誰かを気に入ったかどうか、ニムにはいつだって分かるのさ。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:523
msgid "Nim's off. Tomorrow night, same back door."
msgstr "ニムはもう行くよ。明日の晩、いつもの裏口で。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:523
msgid "Mind the Guild, Keywright. Nim always does."
msgstr "ギルドには気をつけな、鍵師さん。ニムはいつも気をつけてる。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:524
msgid "Sleep well. Nim never does."
msgstr "ぐっすりおやすみ。ニムはいつも寝不足さ。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:527
msgid "Oh, Nim likes it here. Nim will bring more. Every night, more!"
msgstr "ああ、ニム、ここが気に入ったよ。もっと持ってくるね。毎晩、もっと！"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:530
msgid "Back to its owner? How honest. Nim won't tell his friends."
msgstr "持ち主に返すの？正直だねえ。ニムの仲間には内緒にしとくよ。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:531
msgid ""
"Nim's friends will see it gets back to whoever wants it most. For a price. Always a price."
msgstr "ニムの仲間が、いちばん欲しがってる誰かのとこへ届けてくれるさ。お代はいただくけどね。いつだってお代はいただくのさ。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:534
msgid "That would leave your purse thin, that would. Still want it?"
msgstr "そいつを買ったら財布が寂しくなるよ、ほんとにさ。それでも欲しい？"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:537
msgid "Not to your taste? Nim has more. Nim always has more."
msgstr "お気に召さない？ニムにはまだあるよ。ニムにはいつだって、まだあるのさ。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:540
msgid "Back in the pack it goes. Half what you paid: Nim's fair, ask anyone."
msgstr "荷袋に戻しとくよ。払った額の半分ね。ニムは公正さ、誰にでも聞いてごらん。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:72
msgid "Fair Day"
msgstr "市の日"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:72
msgid "The whole county's in town for the fair: three more customers today."
msgstr "郡じゅうの人々が市に集まっている：今日は客が3人増える。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:73
msgid "Locking Day"
msgstr "大施錠の日"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:73
msgid ""
"Three hundred years since the Locking, and everyone's celebrating: everything sells for a quarter more today."
msgstr "大施錠から300年、誰もがお祝い気分：今日はすべての品が25%高く売れる。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:74
msgid "The Crown's Buyer"
msgstr "王家の買い付け人"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:74
msgid "The Crown's buyer is in town, paying double for {kind} today."
msgstr "王家の買い付け人が町に来ている。今日は{kind}を2倍の値で買ってくれる。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:75
msgid "A Royal Chest"
msgstr "王家の宝箱"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:75
msgid ""
"Someone's bringing in one of King Aldric's own chests, gilded, with the royal seal. They think the gold is paint."
msgstr "誰かがアルドリック王その人の宝箱を持ち込んでくる。金箔張りで、王家の印つきだ。売り手は、その金をただの塗料だと思っている。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:76 scripts/Core/Events.cs:199
msgid "The Stranger"
msgstr "黒衣のよそ者"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:76
msgid ""
"A stranger in black is coming by with a chest wrapped in iron chains. Nothing in it can rattle."
msgstr "黒衣のよそ者が、鉄の鎖を巻いた宝箱を持ってやって来る。中の物は何ひとつ音を立てられない。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:77
msgid "A Storm"
msgstr "嵐"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:77
msgid ""
"Few will brave the rain, but those who do bring their best: chests come in a colour better."
msgstr "雨をおして来る客は少ないが、来る者は逸品を持ってくる：宝箱が一段上の色になる。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:78
msgid "A Barge Aground"
msgstr "座礁した荷船"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:78
msgid ""
"A treasure barge ran aground on the Aldwater: today's lots come in twos and threes."
msgstr "宝を積んだ荷船がアルドウォーター川で座礁した：今日の品は2つ3つと組になって入っている。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:79
msgid "A Foreclosure Sale"
msgstr "差し押さえの投げ売り"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:79
msgid ""
"The Guild has foreclosed on a manor, and its chests are being sold off quick: everyone asks a fifth less today."
msgstr "ギルドがある屋敷を差し押さえ、その宝箱が投げ売りされている：今日は誰もが20%安く言ってくる。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:80
msgid "The Tourney"
msgstr "馬上槍試合"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:80
msgid ""
"Knights from four counties are in town for the tourney: weapons and cloaks sell for half again as much today."
msgstr "4つの郡から騎士たちが馬上槍試合に集まっている：今日は武器と外套が1.5倍で売れる。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:81
msgid "A Day of Mourning"
msgstr "喪の日"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:81
msgid ""
"The old Duke is being buried, and the whole town's in black. Nobody will stand for a hard shake today."
msgstr "老公爵の葬儀で、町じゅうが喪に服している。今日は誰も、宝箱を強く振られることを許さない。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:82
msgid "The Town Crier"
msgstr "町の触れ役"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:82
msgid ""
"Old Lord Harrow lost his family's {kind} to the Locking. His crier offers a reward for one today: three times its price."
msgstr "老ハロウ卿は、家に代々伝わる{kind}を大施錠で失った。今日は触れ役が、1つにつき値段の3倍の礼金を出すと触れ回っている。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:83
msgid "The Minstrels' Fair"
msgstr "吟遊詩人の市"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:83
msgid ""
"Minstrels are trading songs in the square, and anyone with a box that hums has brought it: a Heartsong is three times as likely today."
msgstr "吟遊詩人たちが広場で歌を交わし、ハミングする箱を持つ者はこぞってそれを持ち込んでいる：今日は心歌の出る確率が3倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:84
msgid "The Sleepers' Moon"
msgstr "夢見の月"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:84
msgid ""
"The Old Wood's moon was full, and all who slept under it dreamt true, like Mother Sorrel: every seller tells you their dream. Some warded something."
msgstr "古の森の月が満ち、その下で眠った者は皆、マザー・ソレルのように正夢を見た：どの売り手も夢を教えてくれる。何かを結界で封じた者もいる。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:85
msgid "Wardens' Day"
msgstr "衛士の日"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:85
msgid ""
"The old custom: ward a keepsake into a chest before you sell it, and leave a riddle for it. Name the answer, and the ward gives it up."
msgstr "古いしきたり：宝箱を売る前に思い出の品を結界で封じ、なぞなぞを添えておく。答えを言い当てれば、結界はそれを手放す。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:86 scripts/Core/Events.cs:114
msgid "The Guild's Count"
msgstr "ギルドの勘定日"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:86
msgid ""
"The Gilded Guild is counting everything that changes hands: a clerk tallies every article in every chest today, false bottoms and all."
msgstr "金箔ギルドが、取引される物をすべて数えている：今日は書記がどの宝箱の品も、二重底の分まで1点残らず数え上げる。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:87
msgid "The Guild's Assessor"
msgstr "ギルドの査定役"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:87
msgid ""
"A Guild assessor sits in the corner all day, and takes a tenth of every sale for the Guild."
msgstr "ギルドの査定役が一日じゅう店の隅に陣取り、売れるたびに売上の10%をギルドのために取っていく。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:88
msgid "A Witchlight Moon"
msgstr "魔女灯の月"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:88
msgid ""
"Under a witchlight moon the old enchantments wake: things in today's chests are far likelier to be enchanted."
msgstr "魔女灯の月の下で、古い魔力が目を覚ます：今日の宝箱の品は、魔力を帯びている確率がずっと高い。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:100
msgid "Fair Day: +3 customers"
msgstr "市の日：客+3"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:101
msgid "Locking Day: sales +25%"
msgstr "大施錠の日：売値+25%"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:102
msgid "Crown buys {0} x2"
msgstr "王家買付：{0}2倍"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:103
msgid "A royal chest today"
msgstr "今日は王家の宝箱"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:104
msgid "The Stranger's in town"
msgstr "よそ者が来ている"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:105
msgid "Storm: better chests"
msgstr "嵐：上等な宝箱"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:106
msgid "Barge aground: pairs"
msgstr "座礁：品が組で入る"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:107
msgid "Foreclosure sale: -20%"
msgstr "投げ売り：-20%"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:108
msgid "Tourney: arms, cloaks"
msgstr "槍試合：武器・外套"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:109
msgid "Mourning: no hard shake"
msgstr "喪：強く振れない"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:110
msgid "Crier wants {0}"
msgstr "触れ役が{0}を求む"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:111
msgid "Minstrels: songs x3"
msgstr "吟遊詩人：心歌3倍"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:112
msgid "Sleepers' Moon: dreams"
msgstr "夢見の月：お告げ"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:113
msgid "Wardens' Day: riddles"
msgstr "衛士の日：なぞなぞ"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:115
msgid "Assessor: sales -10%"
msgstr "査定役：売上-10%"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:116
msgid "Witchlight: more magic"
msgstr "魔女灯の月：魔力増"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:199
msgid "Stranger"
msgstr "よそ者"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:201
msgid ""
"A stranger in black who sells chests wrapped tight in iron chains, and never says where they're from. Nothing inside can move, so nothing rattles: all you can learn is how heavy it is, and heavy ones hold more."
msgstr ""
"鉄の鎖できつく縛った宝箱を売る、黒衣のよそ者。宝箱の出どころは決して明かさない。中の物は動けないので何も鳴らない。分かるのは重さだけで、重いほど中身は多い。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:203
msgid "Chained tight. No rattles, and no questions. {price}."
msgstr "鎖できつく縛ってある。音はしない。詮索もなしだ。{price}だ。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:203
msgid "Where's it from? Somewhere that wanted it kept shut. {price}."
msgstr "どこから来たか？閉ざしておきたがった場所からだ。{price}だ。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:204
msgid "Some chests are better left shut. Not this one. {price}."
msgstr "開けずにおくべき宝箱もある。これは違う。{price}だ。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:205
msgid "Wise."
msgstr "賢明だ。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:205
msgid "We'll meet again."
msgstr "また会おう。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:206
msgid "Another time."
msgstr "またいずれ。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:207
msgid "As you like."
msgstr "好きにするがいい。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:207
msgid "Someone else, then."
msgstr "では、ほかを当たる。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:208 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:582
msgid "Careful."
msgstr "気をつけろ。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:208
msgid "It won't open for that."
msgstr "そんなことでは開かんぞ。"

#: scripts/Core/Events.cs:209
msgid "Careful. That will cost you."
msgstr "気をつけろ。高くつくぞ。"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:18
msgid "Sight unseen"
msgstr "触れず買い"

#: scripts/Core/Glossary.cs:19
msgid "Bram's word"
msgstr "ブラムの口利き"

